@startuml
title UC9 - View profile

actor User
participant "home_screen.dart\n(HomeScreen)" as HS
participant "perfil_edit.dart\n(PerfilEdit)" as PE
participant "services/profile_store.dart\n(ProfileStore)" as PS
participant "FirebaseAuth SDK" as FA

note over PS : The profile is already in memory: it was loaded with\nGET /users/me when entering the app (UC5 - ver_home.puml).\nViewing it makes no request to the backend.

alt bottom bar
  User -> HS : taps "Perfil"
  HS -> HS : _goToTab(4)
else avatar menu
  User -> HS : taps avatar, then "Perfil completo"
  HS -> HS : _goToTab(4)
end
HS -> PE : shows PerfilEdit
PE -> PS : profile (firstName, lastName, dni, birthDate)
PE -> FA : currentUser.email (falls back to profile.email)
PE -> PE : _fillFromProfile()\nformatDni(), formatDate()
PE -> User : header (initials, full name, email)\nDATOS PERSONALES in read-only fields\nEMAIL marked "solo lectura"
@enduml
